Worker health and delivery failures at a glance:

```apl
['chathub'] | where ['debug_namespace'] == 'chathub-generation-debug'
  and ['debug_event'] in ('worker_started', 'worker_start_failed',
                          'worker_stopped', 'job_malformed', 'sweep_failed',
                          'sse_poll_failed', 'sse_client_stream_failed',
                          'sse_client_poll_failed', 'event_dropped')
